          "title": "根",
          "content": "<p>据人均寿命，2025年出生的婴儿将活着看到下个世纪。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2024/12/31/generation-beta-2025-years/77363820007/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《新一代人类》</a></p>",
