          "title": "人",
          "content": "<p>类所有的问题，都源于人无法独自安静地坐在房间里。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://philosophy.stackexchange.com/questions/69487/why-did-pascal-think-all-of-humanity-s-problems-stem-from-man-s-inability-to-s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">帕斯卡尔</a>，法国哲学家</p>",
